<title>USA: Metatec sees Q3 EPS below yr-ago $0.09.</title>
<headline>Metatec sees Q3 EPS below yr-ago $0.09.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN, Ohio 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metatec Corp said Friday it expects its earnings per share for the third quarter to be flat or below the year-ago period's $0.09 a share.</p>
<p>The company also said its third quarter earnings would fall below analysts' expectations.</p>
<p>Analysts' consensus estimate for the third quarter was $0.11 per share, according to First Call Research Network.</p>
